  "settingsDeleteData": "Delete all local data",
  "settingsDeleteDataHint": "Signs you out and deletes the database, keys and reminders on this device.",
  "deleteDataTitle": "Delete all local data?",
  "deleteDataBody": "All data of this app on this device will be deleted permanently and you will be signed out. Messages and shared events on other family members' devices cannot technically be deleted. Your account on the server remains; ask the server operator to delete it.",
  "deleteDataConfirm": "Delete permanently",
  "privacyTitle": "Privacy policy",
  "privacy1Title": "Who processes your data?",
  "privacy1Body": "FamilyNexus is free software (AGPL-3.0). The app sends no data to its developers and contains no telemetry, advertising or analytics. The operator of the Matrix server you choose is responsible for processing on the server; it is shown during setup.",
  "privacy2Title": "What data exists?",
  "privacy2Body": "Chat messages, files, shared and private events, responses, the shopping list, family members and your settings. Events and messages are stored encrypted (SQLCipher) on your device. The key is held in the Android keystore and never in a file.",
  "privacy3Title": "What does the server see?",
  "privacy3Body": "Messages, files and shared events are end-to-end encrypted (Matrix, Olm/Megolm). The server only sees encrypted events. Metadata such as account ID, timestamps, room size and devices remains visible to the operator. Use your own server to avoid that.",
  "privacy4Title": "Private events",
  "privacy4Body": "Private events are never sent to the family. Between your own devices they are synchronised through a private, encrypted room that only your account belongs to.",
  "privacy5Title": "Reminders and notifications",
  "privacy5Body": "Reminders are local notifications. They never show title, location or note, only “Event in …”. There is no third-party push service.",
  "privacy6Title": "Permissions",
  "privacy6Body": "Internet (connection to the server), notifications and exact alarms (reminders), boot notification (re-schedule reminders) and device credentials (app lock). No contacts, location, camera or microphone are needed.",
  "privacy7Title": "Backup and deletion",
  "privacy7Body": "Android backups are switched off. If you deliberately save an attachment with “Save”, the decrypted file lies outside the app in the folder you chose. “Delete all local data” removes all data, keys and reminders from this device. Messages on other members' devices cannot technically be force-deleted. Your recovery key is the only way to rescue messages after losing all devices – keep it safe.",
  "privacy8Title": "Children",
  "privacy8Body": "Children can be family members. This requires the consent of their legal guardians; accounts of minors go through invitation and confirmation by a moderator.",
  "privacy9Title": "Your rights",
  "privacy9Body": "You can request access, correction and deletion at any time. You manage local data in this app; server data with your server's operator.",
